  m_text: "okay this is going to be long. everyone talks about the villain issues
    but the telescope arc (#3\u2013#5) is where the series figures out what it\u2019s
    about. Comet spends three issues fixing a broken telescope instead of fighting
    anyone, and the whole point is that he\u2019s trying to see something far away
    that nobody else believes is there."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
